block content
    h1 Crohn's Disease
    p Definition by #[a(href="https://www.mayoclinic.org/diseases-conditions/crohns-disease/symptoms-causes/syc-20353304") Mayo Clinic]:
    blockquote Crohn's disease is a type of inflammatory bowel disease (IBD). It causes swelling of the tissues (inflammation) in your digestive tract, which can lead to abdominal pain, severe diarrhea, fatigue, weight loss and malnutrition.

